        "severity": "caution",
        "title": "2 Postgres services still store passwords as md5",
        "detail": "marmot-pg, trino-hub-pg. scram-sha-256 has been the Postgres default since version 14 and md5 is deprecated upstream. Nobody chose this per service, which is exactly why it only shows up across a fleet.",
